# Testing with Vitest and Playwright

## Principle
Test units, components, and E2E flows.

## Guidelines
- Use Vitest for unit and component tests
- Use Playwright for E2E and accessibility tests
- Mock Astro content collections in tests
- Test islands hydration behavior
- Aim for >80% coverage on critical paths

## Setup
```ts
// vitest.config.ts
export default {
  test: {
    environment: 'node',
  }
};
```

## Best Practices
- Test static generation output
- Verify accessibility with axe-core
- Run tests in CI on every PR
